= ecbench report: ECBS1h24a44d1bc573

*Label:* chain-free Koblitz IC: half-dimension Frobenius-invariant base, m = 2 (lookup oracle), K\_0 \/ F\_2^31

*Description:* LEADS.md L2. The chaining term (m-2)n vanishes at m = 2 when the Frobenius-invariant base has dimension near n\/2. Arms at n = 31: the strong signed-Frobenius rho reference and its A\/A control; ic.pipeline on koblitz-standard-subspace bases of dimension 10, 12, 14 with the m = 2 pair-table oracle (negation fold). Counted operations; every phase charged; a measurement, not a performance claim. Dimension 16 was removed after its warm-up failed a 36.5 GB allocation (sessions\/n31-interrupted-d16); the m = 3 one-link inherited-F4 arm was removed after it timed out at 2400 s on the first target at 34 MiB (sessions\/n31-m3-timeout) and is measured at n = 23 instead (spec\_n23.json).

Generated by `ecbench report` (ecbench.report\/v1). Observations only; derived numbers carry the key of their derivation (last section).

